%% Text-to-SQL Agent 状态机（LangGraph）。可用 https://mermaid.live 在线渲染。
flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> rewrite[rewrite 查询改写]
    rewrite --> retrieve[retrieve RAG召回]
    retrieve --> schema_link[schema_link Schema Linking]
    schema_link --> generate[generate 生成/修正SQL]
    generate --> validate[validate 五层校验]
    validate -->|ok 全部PASS| execute[execute 只读沙箱]
    validate -->|retry ERROR且retry小于N| prepare_retry[prepare_retry 递增计数]
    validate -->|blocked BLOCKER| return_error[return_error]
    validate -->|exhausted 重试耗尽| return_error
    prepare_retry --> generate
    execute -->|ok| format[format 自然语言总结]
    execute -->|failed| return_error
    format --> END([END])
    return_error --> END
